  "@type": "SemioticProjection",
  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the child as the experiencer of the textual joke",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the child (VisualMaterial entity) as the subject of the meme's text. The text 'you mean i don't have to pick it and i can eat it?!' is interpreted as the child's internal monologue or reaction, making the user identify with the child's innocent excitement and misunderstanding. The child's visual expression and gesture are mapped to the text, creating a direct projection where the user sees themselves in the child's perspective.",
